  Manual same-day evidence install; no automated KRX fetch.
  The legacy commit-pinned artifact remains the default.
  Calendar-only publication has explicit UUID and --reuse-existing-source modes.
  Current-day EOD reuses the committed calendar source once, preserving its
  UUID, bytes/hash, request metadata, and retrieval time; reuse never recaptures.
  Source wiring only; installed release and deployment are not yet verified.
end note

