legend right
  Arrows = real communication (HTTP / SQL / file / spawn), not depends_on.
  Dashed arrows connected to OVERLAY packages are conditional bind
  declarations, not evidence of deployed communication.
  <<profile:X>> = inactive unless compose --profile X.
  Stream GET is read-only; POST/DELETE mutate actor/session-bound leases.
  Realtime quote activation is WS-only; EOD REST/Raw/artifacts remain
  independent. API/Web have no provider or protected WS state access.
  DB role -> table-group access: migrations/0009_grants.up.sql:5-14,
  0010_rls.up.sql:5-24 (app = tenant CRUD w/ RLS; worker = engine tables;
  research_writer = catalog publication; audit_writer = INSERT-only
  audit_logs; admin = read-only). Migration 0054 adds owner-intraday
  demand/cache/producer tables with app actor RLS and worker fenced writes.
  0055/0056 add stream lease/cache/subscription/producer fences; 0057 gives
  app only a boolean configured-binding helper, not private grant SELECT.
  All edges carry a "' evidence:" comment in this file's source.
endlegend

